
  Homelab provisioning environment

  The installer is running on the serial console. To install from this
  terminal instead, run:

      homelab-install

  It asks every question here, shows a complete summary, and writes nothing
  to any disk until you type the target disk's serial number to authorize it.
  Press Ctrl-C before then to abandon the installation.

  --dry-run  ask everything and print the disk commands instead of running them

